Subject: How can I get the the percentage of phenotype variance explained by a QTL?
Message-ID: <wyHxuaBr-gA.Fl0ULlIsCgAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/rqtl-disc/c/wyHxuaBr-gA/m/Fl0ULlIsCgAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
